00:08:14,651 --> 00:08:20,614
"Early evals show performance close to, perhaps exceeding Opus" - with zero evidence

65
00:08:20,614 --> 00:08:38,201
Elon Musk announced via X that Grok 4.5 (built on the 1.5-trillion-parameter V9 foundation model, supplemented with Cursor training data) is running internally at SpaceX and Tesla in private beta, with performance close to or exceeding Claude Opus .

66
00:08:38,201 --> 00:08:48,889
"Grok 4.5, based on our 1.5T V9 foundation model, with Cursor data added in supplemental training, is now in private beta at SpaceX & Tesla.

67
00:08:48,889 --> 00:08:53,389
Early evals show performance close to, perhaps exceeding Opus."

68
00:08:53,389 --> 00:08:54,901
— Elon Musk, X

69
00:08:54,901 --> 00:09:05,726
Root Cause: xAI has published neither benchmarks nor a system card for Grok 4.5 - no independent evaluation, no methodology, no public access .

70
00:09:05,726 --> 00:09:10,164
The Opus comparison remains a bare claim with no way to verify it.

71
00:09:10,164 --> 00:09:21,251
What we learn: A performance claim without published benchmarks, a system card, or independent verification is marketing, not a result - withhold judgment until the numbers show up.

72
